file=Behavioural Science/trial/custom/field-experiments/SKILL.md · h=name: field-experiments\ntype: custom\nstatus: built from scratch\nassigned_agent: trial (Behavioural Science / Behavioural Experimentation)\nportable: true\ndate_added: 2026-07-29\ntier: 3\ndescription: "Field-experiment deployment — recruitment \· consent \· execution \· monitoring \· closure. Ethics-review mandatory before deployment."\ntriggers:\n- field experiment\n- deploy the experiment\n- run this field trial\n- experiment monitoring\n- close the trial\n · p:=Deploy a designed field experiment (from `behavioural-experiment-design`) — recruit \· consent \· run \· monitor \· close.\n · st:/ Protocol=```\n1. ETHICS       ethics review (bias) → approved / conditional / rejected\n2. RECRUIT      per design; incentive; consent\n3. EXECUTE      per design; adherence tracking\n4. MONITOR      pre-registered stopping rules; adverse events\n5. CLOSE        data collection ends; hand to analysis\n```\n · i:=Ethics-review mandatory. Adverse-event monitoring per operator-set threshold; stop if triggered.\n\nNever analyses in-flight (peeking → false discovery); pre-registered stopping rules only.\n · of:=Trial registry entry + monitoring reports + closure report.\n · pr:=- **Ethics approval before recruit.**\n- **Consent per operator policy.**\n- **Adverse-event monitoring** with pre-set stopping rules.\n- **No in-flight peeking.**\n- **Data retention per policy.**\n · tb=\| Failure \| Response \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Ethics rejects \| Redesign per `behavioural-experiment-design`; do not deploy \| · tb=\| Adverse-event threshold hit \| Stop immediately; report \| · tb=\| Under-recruit \| Extend or redesign; do not lower quality \| · b:=- `behavioural-experiment-design` (this agent) — design source.\n- `bias/ethics-review` — ethics gate.\n- `research` (MI) — recruitment channel.\n- `insight/ad-hoc-analysis` — post-hoc analysis.\n- Shared OS: `verification-before-completion`.\n · tb=\| Skill \| Required \| Optional \| Source line \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| field-experiments \| File read/write \· Survey MCP \· Recruitment MCP \| Consent-management MCP \| All steps \|